<reference id="bacnet-BacnetElevatorGroup" xml:lang="en-us" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">ELGR (Bacnet Elevator Group)</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">The Elevator Group object represents a group of lifts or escalators, a group being defined as those lifts or escalators controlled by a single supervisory controller.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><author translate="no" type="creator" class="- topic/author ">ClaudiaSerwe &lt;claudia.serwe@tridium.com&gt;</author><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "/></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section ">
            <fig class="- topic/fig "><title class="- topic/title ">ELGR properties</title><image placement="break" scale="70" width="600" href="../graphic/ELGR_BacnetObject.png" class="- topic/image "/></fig>
            <p class="- topic/p ">This component is available in the <apiname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/apiname ">bacnetAws</apiname> palette, <apiname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/apiname ">bacnetOws</apiname> palette, and the <apiname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/apiname ">bacnet</apiname> palette.</p><?Pub Caret 77?>
            <p class="- topic/p ">To access these properties, expand <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Drivers</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetAwsNetwork or BacnetNetwork</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetAwsDevice or BacnetDevice</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Config</uicontrol></menucascade> and double-click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">ELGR</uicontrol>.</p>
            <p class="- topic/p ">In addition to the common properties (Status and Fault Cause), this component has these properties.</p>
        </section><properties class="- topic/simpletable reference/properties "><prophead class="- topic/sthead      reference/prophead "><proptypehd class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptypehd ">Property</proptypehd><propvaluehd class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvaluehd ">Value</propvaluehd><propdeschd class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdeschd ">Description</propdeschd></prophead><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Poll Frequency</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">drop-down list (defaults to <option class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/option ">Normal</option>)</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc ">
                    <div conref="../reuse/Reuse1.dita#Reuse1-CAD76CAC/OnDemandPollFrequency-div" class="- topic/div "/>
                </propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Object Id</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">drop-down list and number </propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc ">
                    <div conref="../reuse/Reuse1.dita#Reuse1-CAD76CAC/bacnetObjextId-div" class="- topic/div "/>
                </propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Object Name</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">text in the format <userinput class="+ topic/ph sw-d/userinput ">name.name.name.name</userinput> (default includes the entire component path in the station using period (“/) delimiters between parent.child levels)</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc ">
                    <div conref="../reuse/WH-guide-BACnet.dita#WH-guide-BACnet-0ED816BF/bacnetObjectName-div" class="- topic/div "/>
                </propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Object Type</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">drop-down list of BACnet objects</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc ">
                    <div conref="../reuse/WH-guide-BACnet.dita#WH-guide-BACnet-0ED816BF/bacnetObjectType-div" class="- topic/div "/>
                </propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Machine Room Id</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">drop-down list and number</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "> Indicates the object ID of the Positive Integer Value Object whose present value property
contains the machine room identification number  for the group of lifts or escalators represented by this object. If no machine room identification number is available, this property is set to the object instance number 4194303.</propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Group Id</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">number</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "> Identifies the number for the group of lifts or escalators represented by
this object.</propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Group Members</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue "> read-only </propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "> Displays the objects that are members of the Elevator Group. </propdesc></property></properties></refbody></reference>